; ============================================
; Speed Pattern Test - Klipper Compatible
; Bed: 350x350, Center: 175,175
; Pattern radius: 150mm (25mm margin all sides)
; Tests: X/Y Lines, Diagonals, Square, Star, Circle (24-pt polygon)
; Speeds: 100 to 350 mm/s (350 clamped to 300 by max_velocity)
; Accel: 3000 mm/s^2 override for duration of test
; No filament needed - motion test only
; ============================================
; Coordinates:
;   Left:   X=25   Right:  X=325
;   Front:  Y=25   Back:   Y=325
;   Center: X=175  Y=175
; Circle: 24-pt polygon, radius 150mm from center
; ============================================

G28
G90
G1 Z5 F300
SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT ACCEL=3000 VELOCITY=350
G1 X175 Y175 F6000

